    "body": "## Summary\n- route public fresh start to Stage715Demo after its explicit activation flag\n- remove the legacy Stage7FirstExperience fresh-start fallback\n- preserve the existing resume routing and add a runtime-focused regression harness\n\n## Validation\n- `python3 tools/test_stage7_15_demo_activation_routing.py`\n- `node --check AsyncScene/Web/ui/ui-boot.js`\n- `node --check docs/ui/ui-boot.js`\n- `git diff --check`\n\nKnown unrelated baseline failure: `tools/test_stage7_first_causal_vertical_slice.py` fails on missing `Продолжить` CTA in the existing Stage7FirstExperience source; no files in that controller were changed.",
